#### RLE block: value=A, size=3 expands to AAA

- Verify: RLE block: value=A, size=3 expands to AAA


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 25 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: RLE block: value=A, size=3 expands to AAA")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
var frame: [u8] = []
# magic
frame.push(0x28u8)
frame.push(0xB5u8)
frame.push(0x2Fu8)
frame.push(0xFDu8)
# FHD: SS=1, FCS=1B, no checksum
frame.push(0x20u8)
# FCS: content_size = 3
frame.push(0x03u8)
# Block header: (3<<3)|(1<<1)|1 = 27 = 0x1B
frame.push(0x1Bu8)
frame.push(0x00u8)
frame.push(0x00u8)
# RLE byte: 'A' = 0x41
frame.push(0x41u8)

val res = zstd_decompress(frame)
assert_true(res.ok)
assert_equal(res.data.len(), 3)
assert_equal(res.data[0].to_i64(), 0x41)
assert_equal(res.data[1].to_i64(), 0x41)
assert_equal(res.data[2].to_i64(), 0x41)
```

</details>

